# Skills Entry (workbench)

There is **no** `./ops` wrapper. Canonical skills live in **`.skills/`**; Cursor stubs in **`.cursor/skills/`** redirect there.

| Skill | Scope |
|-------|--------|
| **wb-verify** | L1–L6: build, run cluster, UT/ST, smoke, lint, format |
| **wb-log-analysis** | L7: access/resource HTML, URMA gate, metrics Markdown |
| **wb-perf-research** | L8: `scripts/analysis/perf/*`, URMA index refresh |
| **wb-html-publish** | xqyun `/var/www/html` git, `publish_htmls_git.sh` — verify via `run_skill_html_verify_remote.sh` |
| **wb-docs** | `scripts/documentation/*` workbooks; commit draft is **local** |
| **ds-pr-flow** (datasystem) | GitCode PR review/create — **local WSL** only |

Index: [`INDEX.md`](../../INDEX.md). Script map: [`docs/agent/scripts-map.md`](../../docs/agent/scripts-map.md).

When adding a user-facing script:

1. Put it under `scripts/<area>/`
2. Add the path to the matching skill's command table in `.skills/<name>/SKILL.md`
3. Update `docs/agent/scripts-map.md` and `INDEX.md` if routing changes

Default verify node: **tiantiyun-80c128g** (not xqyun).
